    "Reconcile every non-empty workbook against its source total across all 14 metric columns.",
    "Resolve blank/non-numeric cells without zero coercion.",
    "Freeze metric-definition provenance and semantic changes across years.",
    "Keep annual aggregates separate from event-level evidence."
